WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.833 --> 00:00:05.333
On the eve of Ash’s Kalos Gym battle with Korrina,

2
00:00:05.399 --> 00:00:08.700
our heroes have finally arrived in Shalour City!

3
00:00:09.866 --> 00:00:13.333
Thank you for waiting. Your Pokémon are just fine.

4
00:00:13.399 --> 00:00:14.500
Wigglytuff!

5
00:00:14.566 --> 00:00:16.433
Great! Thanks, Nurse Joy.

6
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.933
- Pika, Pika!
- All right!

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.533
- Now we can go and challenge Korrina!
- Pika!

8
00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:23.599
- Wow, Ash. You can’t wait!
- Na-na-na!

9
00:00:23.666 --> 00:00:26.366
But still, Korrina and Lucario were strong.

10
00:00:26.433 --> 00:00:29.666
Are you sure you’re ready? Maybe you should train more.

11
00:00:29.733 --> 00:00:33.000
He’s right. What about Tierno’s rhythmic battle style?

12
00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:35.933
Have you mastered that yet? I’m just saying.

13
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.900
Hey, I’ll be fine. Long as I tackle that battle head on, it’ll all work out!

14
00:00:41.966 --> 00:00:44.833
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

15
00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:47.500
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

16
00:00:48.599 --> 00:00:51.066
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

17
00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:54.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

18
00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.233
♪ Pokémon Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

19
00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.599
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

20
00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:03.966
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

21
00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:06.399
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

22
00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:08.899
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

23
00:01:08.966 --> 00:01:11.966
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

24
00:01:21.899 --> 00:01:25.500
- Wow! It’s so beautiful!
- It sure is!

25
00:01:27.666 --> 00:01:32.000
That’s the Tower of Mastery! The Shalour Gym should be inside.

26
00:01:32.066 --> 00:01:33.899
How do we get there?

27
00:01:33.966 --> 00:01:35.066
- Pika?
- Na-na?

28
00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:37.600
I don’t see any sort of a bridge.

29
00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:40.066
Looks like it’s just floating in the ocean.

30
00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.833
-We can’t get over there by walking.

31
00:01:42.899 --> 00:01:44.399
- Pika.
- Come on.

32
00:01:44.466 --> 00:01:48.566
We came all this way and can’t get to the Gym? That’s nuts!

33
00:01:48.633 --> 00:01:52.133
- I want to have a battle now!
- Pika! Pika!

34
00:01:52.199 --> 00:01:56.199
Those who seek power!

35
00:01:56.266 --> 00:01:59.833
Show your heart and the path shall reveal itself!

36
00:01:59.899 --> 00:02:01.266
-Pika!

37
00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:05.699
- Korrina!
- Just playing!

38
00:02:05.766 --> 00:02:08.400
-And Lucario, too!

39
00:02:08.466 --> 00:02:10.699
- Pikachu!
- What a cool surprise!

40
00:02:10.766 --> 00:02:12.666
So good to see you again!

41
00:02:12.733 --> 00:02:16.066
Good to see you again, too! Welcome to Shalour City!

42
00:02:16.133 --> 00:02:19.100
- You came over here just to meet us?
- Yup!

43
00:02:19.166 --> 00:02:22.333
I figured you’d be showing up soon, so I’ve been waiting for you.

44
00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:25.700
If you’re trying to get to the Shalour Gym, that means one thing.

45
00:02:25.766 --> 00:02:28.666
You must be fully prepared to challenge me.

46
00:02:28.733 --> 00:02:30.066
- That true?
- Of course!

47
00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:32.333
But you haven’t decided on a strategy yet.

48
00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:36.566
I’ve been training hard since I last saw you and I’ve beaten every challenger!

49
00:02:36.633 --> 00:02:39.100
So that means you’ve won all your battles.

50
00:02:39.166 --> 00:02:41.933
Wow, you’re so strong!

51
00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.566
- Amazing. Awesome!
- Pika!

52
00:02:44.633 --> 00:02:50.333
But soon, I’m going to beat you and Mega Lucario and win my third Kalos Gym badge!

53
00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.966
We’ve got a problem. Isn’t the Gym over there?

54
00:02:54.033 --> 00:02:56.100
How are we going to get across?

55
00:02:56.166 --> 00:02:59.733
- Can’t do it now.
- We can’t? No way!

56
00:02:59.799 --> 00:03:01.166
Why not?

57
00:03:01.233 --> 00:03:05.333
There’s a saying. Those with a desire to battle must wait patiently.

58
00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:08.299
- What are you talking about?
- Grandfather says it a lot.

59
00:03:08.366 --> 00:03:10.666
It’s the motto our family lives by.

60
00:03:10.733 --> 00:03:13.633
It’s going to be a while before we can get over there.

61
00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:16.166
Oh, no! But I want to have a battle now!

62
00:03:16.233 --> 00:03:18.333
Now, now. Calm down. It’s okay.

63
00:03:18.399 --> 00:03:20.866
This way you’ll have more time to train.

64
00:03:20.933 --> 00:03:23.500
Remember, Korrina’s even stronger now.

65
00:03:23.566 --> 00:03:25.299
Guess you’re right.

66
00:03:26.733 --> 00:03:28.433
- Pikachu!
- Fletch!

67
00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.166
- Froakie!
- Lucha! Haw!

68
00:03:30.233 --> 00:03:32.166
You’ve caught a Hawlucha!

69
00:03:32.233 --> 00:03:35.733
And Fletchling evolved into Fletchinder, a Fire and Flying type!

70
00:03:35.799 --> 00:03:37.600
You’ve really been thinking about a strategy

71
00:03:37.666 --> 00:03:39.666
to counter our Fighting-type Gym.

72
00:03:39.733 --> 00:03:42.500
- Sure have.
- But hold on.

73
00:03:42.566 --> 00:03:45.633
If you’re going to train, I probably shouldn’t watch, right?

74
00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:50.100
That’s a good point. If you watch Ash train, that would give away his strategy.

75
00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:53.366
- That’s okay with me.
- Oh, you sure?

76
00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.899
We always battle our opponent head on!

77
00:03:55.966 --> 00:03:59.399
We’ve got nothing to hide, do we?

78
00:03:59.466 --> 00:04:01.666
Let’s work on moving and grooving.

79
00:04:01.733 --> 00:04:05.166
Then we’ll win that Gym badge!

80
00:04:05.233 --> 00:04:07.133
All right. Here we go!

81
00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.866
- Yay! Let the music play!
- Uh?

82
00:04:09.933 --> 00:04:13.866
Okay! Everyone, it’s time to dance!

83
00:04:13.933 --> 00:04:18.933
- Pika, Pika, Chu, Chu! Pikachu!
- You're doing great, Pikachu!

84
00:04:20.133 --> 00:04:22.833
Ches! Chespin! Ches!

85
00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:25.766
- Uh, Chespin?
- Chespin! Chespin!

86
00:04:25.833 --> 00:04:28.166
Wow. Look at Chespin go.

87
00:04:28.233 --> 00:04:30.233
Chespin sure is a good dancer!

88
00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:33.733
Fletchinder, Chinder! Fletch!

89
00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:37.233
Look at that. Fletchinder’s totally graceful!

90
00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:40.566
Lucha-cha-cha! Cha-haw! Cha-cha-haw! Haw!

91
00:04:40.633 --> 00:04:43.800
- Hawlucha’s a great dancer, too!
- Na-na-na!

92
00:04:43.866 --> 00:04:47.066
Froakie Kie! Froakie Kie! Froakie Kie!

93
00:04:47.133 --> 00:04:50.233
Froakie’s no slouch as well.

94
00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.266
The problem is...

95
00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:57.433
- I think Ash is trying to dance.
- All right! Yeah!

96
00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:00.433
That’s dancing?! He looks more like he’s woozy!

97
00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.200
Bonnie, please! Ash is doing the best he can!

98
00:05:03.266 --> 00:05:06.466
Now I’ve seen it all. That’s Ash’s training?

99
00:05:06.533 --> 00:05:09.433
Sure is! Move it. And groove it!

100
00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.866
First off, we’ve got to do something about those moves.

101
00:05:12.933 --> 00:05:15.166
For sure. How do we do that?

102
00:05:15.233 --> 00:05:18.700
The future is now, thanks to science!

103
00:05:18.766 --> 00:05:21.866
Clemontic Gear on!

104
00:05:21.933 --> 00:05:25.800
This is my Not a Very Good Dancer Automated Good Dancing Device!

105
00:05:25.866 --> 00:05:28.566
- What’s going on? Oh!
- Pika!

106
00:05:28.633 --> 00:05:33.033
A revolution in dance, allowing anyone with no rhythm to move and groove.

107
00:05:33.099 --> 00:05:37.200
- Following the beat to a tee!
- But we’re talking about Ash here.

108
00:05:37.266 --> 00:05:41.066
- This I got to see.
- You shall! Okay, here we go!

109
00:05:41.133 --> 00:05:42.800
Full power. Switch on!

110
00:05:42.866 --> 00:05:44.966
Huh? Hey, wait!

111
00:05:45.033 --> 00:05:46.700
- Whoa, whoa!
- Pikapi?

112
00:05:46.766 --> 00:05:50.233
- Whoa, Ash is dancing!
- Who knew?

113
00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:51.866
Continued practice with my device

114
00:05:51.933 --> 00:05:54.633
will have him dancing like a natural in no time!

115
00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:58.300
And now let’s pick up the tempo just a little bit!

116
00:05:58.366 --> 00:06:01.033
Up, up, up, up, up, up!

117
00:06:01.099 --> 00:06:06.333
Stop this crazy thing! Come on!

118
00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:09.599
- Clemont, make it stop!
- I’m trying! I’m trying!

119
00:06:09.666 --> 00:06:12.400
I’m getting dizzy. I feel sick.

120
00:06:12.466 --> 00:06:13.933
It’s not stopping.

121
00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.566
- Look out!
- Oh, no!

122
00:06:19.599 --> 00:06:23.333
Oh, man! Everything’s spinning!

123
00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:26.766
- My head. Glad that’s over with.
- I’m so sorry.

124
00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:30.866
What about your training, Ash? Are you done?

125
00:06:30.933 --> 00:06:32.599
I was getting so close.

126
00:06:32.666 --> 00:06:35.599
Wait. Hey, I’ll be your dance teacher!

127
00:06:35.666 --> 00:06:39.133
- Huh?
- Sure! I’m an excellent dancer.

128
00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.366
Are you really?

129
00:06:41.433 --> 00:06:42.833
Just leave it to me!

130
00:06:49.099 --> 00:06:51.633
Hm!

131
00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.066
I’m wiped!

132
00:06:53.133 --> 00:06:55.299
I don’t think this is working out so well.

133
00:06:55.366 --> 00:06:58.799
I’m tapped out. I don’t know what else to teach you.

134
00:06:58.866 --> 00:07:02.166
People are good at some things and not so good at others.

135
00:07:02.233 --> 00:07:05.866
So maybe the rhythmic battle strategy isn’t the right thing for Ash.

136
00:07:05.933 --> 00:07:09.799
- But can he beat Korrina without it?
- Hm.

137
00:07:11.166 --> 00:07:15.866
You tried. Thanks, Serena! You, too, Clemont.

138
00:07:15.933 --> 00:07:20.633
- But, Ash, are you okay?
- Yeah! I’ve got one choice.

139
00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.933
- I’ll give it all I’ve got!
- Pikachu!

140
00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.099
- Ash?
- Huh?

141
00:07:24.166 --> 00:07:27.099
- Have you finished your training?
- Yeah!

142
00:07:27.166 --> 00:07:31.299
Perfect timing then! We’ll be able to get over to the island soon!

143
00:07:31.366 --> 00:07:32.766
Soon?

144
00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.166
So how’s that going to happen?

145
00:07:40.233 --> 00:07:42.566
Wait. You’ll see.

146
00:07:42.633 --> 00:07:43.966
Mm?

147
00:07:53.633 --> 00:07:55.500
-Look at that!

148
00:07:55.566 --> 00:07:57.566
A path, but how?

149
00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.466
Awesome!

150
00:08:03.533 --> 00:08:07.633
- Korrina, what’s happening?
- Pika, Pika!

151
00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:11.299
When it’s the right time, a path to the island appears.

152
00:08:14.833 --> 00:08:17.466
Let’s go!

153
00:08:17.533 --> 00:08:20.466
- Yes!
- Pikachu!

154
00:08:20.533 --> 00:08:23.633
So weird that a path appears in the ocean!

155
00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:26.466
Like a fantasy world created by the changing tides!

156
00:08:28.599 --> 00:08:31.599
This is the Tower of Mastery. The Gym’s inside.

157
00:08:31.666 --> 00:08:34.600
All right! Let’s go have that battle!

158
00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:37.233
No need to be hasty!

159
00:08:37.299 --> 00:08:39.100
- Huh?
- Pika?

160
00:08:41.033 --> 00:08:42.533
Grandfather!

161
00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.500
How are you, sir?

162
00:08:45.566 --> 00:08:47.733
- Nice to see you again!
- Pika, Pika!

163
00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:51.666
- Hm. Glad you made it.
- Me, too. I’m here to challenge the Gym!

164
00:08:51.733 --> 00:08:55.566
But before you do, you must listen to what I tell you!

165
00:08:55.633 --> 00:08:59.166
Fact is, that’s the rule when anyone comes to this island!

166
00:08:59.233 --> 00:09:02.033
- Uh, if you say so.
- Pika.

167
00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.433
Here we go again.

168
00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:07.666
- What do you want to tell us?
- A valuable story.

169
00:09:07.733 --> 00:09:11.433
It concerns Mega Evolution! Come, come. Follow me.

170
00:09:12.966 --> 00:09:15.733
Heads up. Get ready for a long story.

171
00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:16.933
-Pika.

172
00:09:20.633 --> 00:09:21.866
-Pika!

173
00:09:21.933 --> 00:09:24.300
It’s huge!

174
00:09:24.366 --> 00:09:27.866
- Is that Mega Lucario?
- Amazing!

175
00:09:27.933 --> 00:09:31.100
I’ve never seen such a large statue before!

176
00:09:31.166 --> 00:09:37.566
It symbolizes our family friend and our bond with Mega Lucario!

177
00:09:37.633 --> 00:09:40.133
Who’s that Pokémon?

178
00:09:44.633 --> 00:09:46.733
It’s Pumpkaboo!

179
00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.366
You see, the history of Mega Evolution

180
00:09:53.433 --> 00:09:56.566
began long ago with the arrival of one of my ancestors,

181
00:09:56.633 --> 00:09:58.933
right here on this island.

182
00:10:01.333 --> 00:10:04.699
This man was traveling and training with his Lucario

183
00:10:04.766 --> 00:10:07.800
when they found two peculiar stones right here.

184
00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.866
It is generally believed that what happened next

185
00:10:29.933 --> 00:10:32.233
was the world’s first Mega Evolution.

186
00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:35.066
So this is where Mega Evolution started.

187
00:10:35.133 --> 00:10:37.000
- Pika!
- That’s right.

188
00:10:37.066 --> 00:10:41.933
Our family has lived here and protected Mega Evolution Island ever since.

189
00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:45.199
That’s great! What an interesting story that is!

190
00:10:45.266 --> 00:10:46.966
I never knew that before!

191
00:10:47.033 --> 00:10:50.166
- Wow, this is an important place.
- Yeah, you bet?

192
00:10:50.233 --> 00:10:54.100
I want to become a great Gym Leader just like Grandfather and my ancestor!

193
00:10:54.166 --> 00:10:56.466
Wait a sec. Your Lucario can Mega Evolve

194
00:10:56.533 --> 00:10:58.733
and you’re already a great Gym Leader, right?

195
00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:00.900
- You think? Go on!
- Stop.

196
00:11:00.966 --> 00:11:03.300
To me, she still has a long way to go!

197
00:11:03.366 --> 00:11:07.433
It’s too soon to pass down the Scroll of Secrets to her.

198
00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:09.800
Huh? Not that again.

199
00:11:09.866 --> 00:11:13.100
Excuse me. What’s the Scroll of Secrets?

200
00:11:13.166 --> 00:11:14.466
A family treasure.

201
00:11:14.533 --> 00:11:18.633
It lists everything one needs to know to be a Gym Leader.

202
00:11:18.699 --> 00:11:20.033
Could we see it?

203
00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:21.333
Please, show us!

204
00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:24.233
- I’d love to see what it says!
- Not possible.

205
00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:26.400
Only those chosen are allowed to see it!

206
00:11:26.466 --> 00:11:27.733
- Aw!
- Pika!

207
00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:32.133
Grandfather has it hidden away somewhere and won’t show it to anybody.

208
00:11:32.199 --> 00:11:33.300
Hm!

209
00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:38.966
-Uh-oh! Empty tummy!

210
00:11:39.033 --> 00:11:42.266
- Pikachu!
- The fact is, we haven’t had dinner yet.

211
00:11:42.333 --> 00:11:46.433
In that case, since it’s already late, let’s have our Gym battle tomorrow.

212
00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:48.900
You guys can stay here tonight. It’s been a while.

213
00:11:48.966 --> 00:11:51.300
- Let’s have dinner together!
- Good idea.

214
00:11:51.366 --> 00:11:53.100
- Thanks!
- Pikachu!

215
00:11:53.166 --> 00:11:55.500
Yay! I’m starving!

216
00:11:55.566 --> 00:11:57.333
Scroll of Secrets, eh?

217
00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:01.300
Bet there’s lots of Mega Evolution stuff in that thing.

218
00:12:01.366 --> 00:12:04.066
Say, if we were to take it and gift it to the Boss...

219
00:12:04.133 --> 00:12:06.233
Not to would be a loss!

220
00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:08.266
- Wobbuffet!
- Quiet!

221
00:12:26.699 --> 00:12:29.833
Drat!

222
00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:31.800
Oh!

223
00:12:39.133 --> 00:12:42.300
If it’s not in that old codger’s room...

224
00:12:42.366 --> 00:12:45.599
Then it’s got to be here somewhere! Let’s find it!

225
00:12:45.666 --> 00:12:46.566
Wobbuff!

226
00:12:46.633 --> 00:12:47.833
- Shh!
- Stifle it!

227
00:12:51.699 --> 00:12:53.599
Na-na-na-na!

228
00:12:57.633 --> 00:12:59.933
Zip. Zero. Nada!

229
00:13:00.066 --> 00:13:01.699
Nothing in here.

230
00:13:01.766 --> 00:13:05.599
Then stop looking where it isn’t and start looking where it is!

231
00:13:05.666 --> 00:13:08.400
We got to start thinking like a scroll.

232
00:13:08.466 --> 00:13:10.466
Wobbuf! Wobbuf!

233
00:13:10.533 --> 00:13:14.366
Hm? Is that a statue of Mega Lucario?

234
00:13:14.433 --> 00:13:16.966
Mega Evolution. Maybe it’s in there!

235
00:13:17.033 --> 00:13:19.566
- I like the way you think!
- Nice!

236
00:13:29.166 --> 00:13:31.633
- Suspicious.
- Truly.

237
00:13:31.699 --> 00:13:34.066
My arm won’t fit.

238
00:13:37.166 --> 00:13:39.066
Well, lookee what we got here!

239
00:13:40.599 --> 00:13:43.133
- Scroll time.
- Sublime!

240
00:13:43.199 --> 00:13:46.099
- Huh?
- Who’s up there?

241
00:13:48.699 --> 00:13:51.000
- What are you doing?
- Busted!

242
00:13:51.066 --> 00:13:53.500
Your Scroll of Secrets is a secret no more!

243
00:13:53.566 --> 00:13:56.400
- Can the roar!
- We’re out the door!

244
00:13:56.466 --> 00:13:58.400
What a bore!

245
00:13:58.466 --> 00:14:00.466
Give me back my scroll!

246
00:14:00.533 --> 00:14:02.066
-Grandfather!

247
00:14:02.133 --> 00:14:04.733
Korrina, they stole the Scroll of Secrets!

248
00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:06.633
- Huh?
- Who’s there?

249
00:14:06.699 --> 00:14:09.233
Prepare for trouble, it’s us, of course!

250
00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:11.633
And we’re taking the Scroll of Secrets by force!

251
00:14:11.699 --> 00:14:14.133
To protect the world from devastation!

252
00:14:14.199 --> 00:14:17.133
To unite all people within our nation!

253
00:14:17.199 --> 00:14:20.233
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

254
00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:23.433
To extend our reach to the stars above!

255
00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.966
- Jessie!
- And James!

256
00:14:26.033 --> 00:14:28.699
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

257
00:14:28.766 --> 00:14:31.866
Surrender now or prepare for a not-so-secret fight!

258
00:14:31.933 --> 00:14:35.166
- Meowth, that’s right!
- Wobbuffet!

259
00:14:36.433 --> 00:14:39.166
- Team Rocket? I should’ve known!
- Pika!

260
00:14:39.233 --> 00:14:41.933
Any slower and you’d be talking backwards!

261
00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:43.300
Swipers keepers!

262
00:14:43.366 --> 00:14:47.233
- I will not allow you to do this!
- Grandfather!

263
00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.900
I once had a schoolteacher just like you!

264
00:14:49.966 --> 00:14:53.099
With that in mind, we’ll say toodaloo!

265
00:14:53.166 --> 00:14:57.266
- Grandpa, let us handle this!
- We’ll get the scroll back!

266
00:14:57.333 --> 00:15:01.666
- Are you okay?
- I can’t run anymore!

267
00:15:01.733 --> 00:15:04.566
- Not again!
- You’re not getting away!

268
00:15:04.633 --> 00:15:06.066
Annoy people much?

269
00:15:06.133 --> 00:15:09.000
- Inkay, go!
- Ink!

270
00:15:09.066 --> 00:15:12.433
- Psybeam, please!
- Inkay!

271
00:15:14.033 --> 00:15:16.500
-Korrina!

272
00:15:16.566 --> 00:15:18.566
Thanks, Lucario!

273
00:15:18.633 --> 00:15:20.400
- And thanks to you, too!
- Ha!

274
00:15:20.466 --> 00:15:24.199
- Again, Inkay! Use Psybeam!
- Ink...

275
00:15:24.266 --> 00:15:27.666
I don’t think so. Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!

276
00:15:27.733 --> 00:15:30.300
Pikachu!

277
00:15:30.366 --> 00:15:33.233
-Eesh!

278
00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:36.500
- Hey, nice move, Ash and Pikachu!
- Let’s get moving!

279
00:15:39.066 --> 00:15:41.233
Step on it, buster!

280
00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:43.300
-Come back!

281
00:15:43.366 --> 00:15:45.333
- Pika!
- Braying brats!

282
00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:46.900
Wobb, Wobb! Wobb, Wobb!

283
00:15:50.466 --> 00:15:52.933
Give the scroll back!

284
00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.933
Pikachu! Iron Tail, let’s go!

285
00:15:57.000 --> 00:16:02.666
Pika! Chu! Kachu! Pika!

286
00:16:02.733 --> 00:16:04.166
Hm?

287
00:16:08.366 --> 00:16:10.533
- Bye.
- That was my head!

288
00:16:10.599 --> 00:16:14.933
- We weren’t ready to go yet!
- Why don't you guys just give it up?

289
00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:18.300
- You’re going nowhere!
- And neither is this scroll!

290
00:16:18.366 --> 00:16:21.366
- Pumpkaboo!
- Pumpkaboo!

291
00:16:21.433 --> 00:16:23.599
- You ready, Pikachu?
- Pika!

292
00:16:23.666 --> 00:16:27.333
- Wait, Ash! I’ll take care of them!
- Huh?

293
00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:29.566
What? Just you two lightweights?

294
00:16:29.633 --> 00:16:32.733
Right! You got some sort of a problem with that?

295
00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:35.400
Such sass! Okay, Inkay, Psybeam!

296
00:16:35.466 --> 00:16:37.933
- Inkay!
- Dodge it, quick!

297
00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:41.500
Pumpkaboo, use Shadow Ball!

298
00:16:41.566 --> 00:16:43.966
Now! Bone Rush!

299
00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:49.433
-Pumpkaboo, no!

300
00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:53.733
Awesome! The two of them are perfectly in sync!

301
00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:55.466
- No!
- No, no, no, no, no!

302
00:16:55.533 --> 00:16:58.733
- Well, in that case, attack en masse!
- I’m in, too!

303
00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:01.033
- Use Shadow Ball!
- Use Tackle!

304
00:17:01.099 --> 00:17:03.300
Fury Swipes time!

305
00:17:03.366 --> 00:17:07.566
Dodge them, Lucario!

306
00:17:07.633 --> 00:17:09.399
-Now what?

307
00:17:11.466 --> 00:17:13.466
Ready?

308
00:17:13.533 --> 00:17:15.399
Mega Evolve!

309
00:17:17.466 --> 00:17:20.666
Huh? - Whoa!

310
00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.300
- Is that...?
- Yes.

311
00:17:31.366 --> 00:17:33.666
Ready, Lucario?

312
00:17:33.733 --> 00:17:35.733
So? Knock yourselves out!

313
00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:37.800
Use Shadow Ball!

314
00:17:37.866 --> 00:17:42.666
Lucario! Use Bone Rush!

315
00:17:43.666 --> 00:17:46.966
Inkay!

316
00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:51.800
- We’re blasting off again!
- Wobbuffet!

317
00:17:51.866 --> 00:17:54.533
- Inkay!
- Kaboo!

318
00:17:57.666 --> 00:18:00.500
Korrina and Lucario are so amazing!

319
00:18:00.566 --> 00:18:03.466
- Don’t you think so too, buddy?
- Pika!

320
00:18:03.533 --> 00:18:07.100
And we get to battle them tomorrow! I can hardly wait!

321
00:18:07.166 --> 00:18:09.466
- All set?
- Pikachu!

322
00:18:09.533 --> 00:18:12.000
Here it is! We got your scroll back!

323
00:18:12.066 --> 00:18:14.800
Well done! You make me very proud.

324
00:18:17.333 --> 00:18:21.800
- That’s the Scroll of Secrets!
- What does it say? Show us!

325
00:18:21.866 --> 00:18:25.166
- But we’re not allowed to see it, right?
- Hm.

326
00:18:25.233 --> 00:18:30.500
Since you managed to get the scroll back to me, I guess I can make an exception.

327
00:18:30.566 --> 00:18:32.399
- Wow, you mean it?
- Pika!

328
00:18:32.466 --> 00:18:33.933
Yay!

329
00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.933
Now.

330
00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.666
Rule one! Early to bed and early to rise!

331
00:18:39.733 --> 00:18:43.899
Rule two! Eat in moderation, even if it’s delicious!

332
00:18:43.966 --> 00:18:48.366
Rule three! Keep all of your belongings organized and readily available!

333
00:18:48.433 --> 00:18:49.866
- Huh?
- But, sir?

334
00:18:49.933 --> 00:18:54.266
Rule four! Wash your hands several times a day!

335
00:18:54.333 --> 00:18:57.233
Um, is that really the Scroll of Secrets?

336
00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:02.166
You doubt me? It took a lot of effort. I spent countless hours writing this

337
00:19:02.233 --> 00:19:05.466
all so Gym Leaders could be at the peak of perfection!

338
00:19:05.533 --> 00:19:09.966
- Uh, that’s what you wrote?
- Hm! Profound, right?

339
00:19:10.033 --> 00:19:15.000
So then there’s nothing in there about Mega Evolution or your ancestors’ history?

340
00:19:15.066 --> 00:19:17.766
Ah, no, not a single thing.

341
00:19:23.933 --> 00:19:28.399
The Shalour City Gym Battle between Ash and Korrina will now begin!

342
00:19:28.466 --> 00:19:30.633
Each Trainer may use three Pokémon!

343
00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:34.466
Furthermore, only the challenger will be allowed to substitute Pokémon!

344
00:19:34.533 --> 00:19:36.466
Ash, you can do it!

345
00:19:36.533 --> 00:19:38.966
- Make sure you don’t lose!
- Both of you do your best!

346
00:19:39.033 --> 00:19:42.466
- You ready to go for it, Pikachu?
- Pika! Pika!

347
00:19:42.533 --> 00:19:45.466
Gym Leader Korrina, come forth!

348
00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:57.733
Huh?

349
00:20:12.533 --> 00:20:15.066
So, we battle once again. Finally!

350
00:20:15.133 --> 00:20:18.033
Right! I’ve been looking forward to this.

351
00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:20.066
- I am totally psyched!
- Pikachu!

352
00:20:20.133 --> 00:20:22.166
Me, too. I’ll give it my all!

353
00:20:22.233 --> 00:20:25.899
- Great! And I’ll be doing the same thing!
- Pika! Pika!

354
00:20:25.966 --> 00:20:30.666
Ash sounds confident, but I wonder if he’s really going to be all right.

355
00:20:30.733 --> 00:20:31.966
Yeah, I do, too.

356
00:20:32.033 --> 00:20:35.166
- Go, go, go, Ash!
- Na-na-na!

357
00:20:35.233 --> 00:20:38.899
The Gym battle between Ash and Korrina is about to get under way!

358
00:20:38.966 --> 00:20:41.833
Will our hero be able to defeat Mega Lucario

359
00:20:41.899 --> 00:20:44.466
and win his third Kalos Gym badge?

360
00:20:44.533 --> 00:20:47.733
Stay tuned, as the journey continues!
